      <summary>
        <versionCode>00</versionCode>
        <actionDate>2026-07-21</actionDate>
        <actionDesc>Introduced in Senate</actionDesc>
        <updateDate>2026-08-04T16:25:36Z</updateDate>
        <text><![CDATA[<p><strong>License to Drill Act</strong></p><p>This bill extends through FY2037 the Bureau of Land Management’s (BLM’s) authority to collect oil and gas permit processing fees. For each new permit application, BLM collects a fee that is transferred to the BLM Permit Processing Improvement Fund.&nbsp;(Under current law, the fees are authorized through FY2026.)</p>]]></text>
      </summary>
    </summaries>
